 could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".\n\nDATA (build the UI around this content):\n{\n  \"persona\": {\n    \"name\": \"Mira Kovač\",\n    \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n    \"city\": \"Ljubljana\",\n    \"bio\": \"I design calm, usable software for public services and small teams. Ten years across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping.\",\n    \"availability\": \"Open to freelance work from January\",\n    \"email\": \"mira@example.com\",\n    \"links\": [\n      \"Dribbble\",\n      \"LinkedIn\",\n      \"Read.cv\"\n    ],\n    \"stats\": [\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Years designing\",\n        \"value\": \"10\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Products shipped\",\n        \"value\": \"24\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"People reached\",\n        \"value\": \"1.2M\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"Interaction design\",\n      \"User research\",\n      \"Design systems\",\n      \"Prototyping\",\n      \"Service design\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"projects\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Transit app redesign\",\n      \"year\": 2026,\n      \"role\": \"Lead designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Ljubljana Public Transport\",\n      \"summary\": \"Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"App store rating rose from 3.4 to 4.6 in six months.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"mobile\",\n        \"research\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Clinic booking system\",\n      \"year\": 2025,\n      \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Zdravje Clinics\",\n      \"summary\": \"Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"58% fewer booking calls; 91% of patients book online.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"web\",\n        \"service design\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Open data dashboard\",\n      \"year\": 2024,\n      \"role\": \"Design and front-end\",\n      \"client\": \"City of Ljubljana\",\n      \"summary\": \"City budget explorer used by 30k residents.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"Featured by two national newspapers; open-sourced.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"data viz\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"testimonial\": {\n    \"quote\": \"Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.\",\n    \"author\": \"Tina Zupan\",\n    \"role\": \"Head of Digital, LPP\"\n  }\n}","systemHash":"7f7b03405c279f095db892fdd24437dfc241ff3c8abb65e91da9e557823238ce","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .hero {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);\n  }\n  .hero::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 280px;\n    height: 280px;\n    right: -90px;\n    top: -100px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent, #5b5bd6) 16%, transparent);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .hero-inner {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    max-width: 760px;\n  }\n  .profile-mark {\n    width: 64px;\n    height: 64px;\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #6966dd, #4543a8);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 1.35rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(54, 52, 145, 0.24);\n  }\n  .project-card {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    min-height: 100%;\n  }\n  .project-card .card-title {\n    margin-top: 0.75rem;\n  }\n  .project-meta {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n  }\n  .project-impact {\n    margin-top: auto;\n    padding-top: 1.25rem;\n  }\n  .project-number {\n    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: -0.06em;\n    color: var(--accent, #5553c5);\n  }\n  .skill-list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n    list-style: none;\n  }\n  .contact-panel {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #17172b, #292951);\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n  .contact-panel .muted,\n  .contact-panel .stat-label {\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.68);\n  }\n  .contact-panel .btn-secondary {\n    color: #fff;\n    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  }\n  .quote-mark {\n    font-size: 3.5rem;\n    line-height: 0.8;\n    color: #7774dd;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .project-meta {\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <section class=\"hero card\">\n    <div class=\"hero-inner stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"profile-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">MK</div>\n        <div>\n          <h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:0\">Mira Kovač</h1>\n          <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0.2rem 0 0\">Product designer · Ljubljana</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"lead\">I design calm, usable software for public services and small teams.</p>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Ten years across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge\">Open to freelance work from January</span>\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"mailto:mira@example.com\">mira@example.com</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Visit Mira's Dribbble profile\">Dribbble</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Visit Mira's LinkedIn profile\">LinkedIn</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Read Mira's CV\">Read.cv</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"impact-heading\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h2 id=\"impact-heading\" class=\"h2\">Experience at a glance</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">A decade of turning complex services into straightforward experiences.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Years designing</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">10</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Products shipped</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">24</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">People reached</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">1.2M</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"projects-heading\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h2 id=\"projects-heading\" class=\"h2\">Selected projects</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Research-led product and service design, from first insight to shipped experience.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\">\n      <article class=\"card project-card\">\n        <div class=\"project-meta\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2026</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Mobile · Research</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"card-title h3\">Transit app redesign</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Lead designer · Ljubljana Public Transport</p>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.</p>\n        <div class=\"project-impact\">\n          <div class=\"project-number\">3.4 → 4.6</div>\n          <div class=\"small muted\">App store rating in six months</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:1rem\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">mobile</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">research</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card project-card\">\n        <div class=\"project-meta\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2025</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Web · Service design</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"card-title h3\">Clinic booking system</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Product designer · Zdravje Clinics</p>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.</p>\n        <div class=\"project-impact\">\n          <div class=\"project-number\">91%</div>\n          <div class=\"small muted\">of patients book online</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:1rem\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">web</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">service design</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card project-card\">\n        <div class=\"project-meta\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2024</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Data visualization</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"card-title h3\">Open data dashboard</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Design and front-end · City of Ljubljana</p>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">City budget explorer used by 30k residents.</p>\n        <div class=\"project-impact\">\n          <div class=\"project-number\">30k</div>\n          <div class=\"small muted\">residents using the explorer</div>\n          <p class=\"small\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\"><strong>Featured by two national newspapers; open-sourced.</strong></p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:1rem\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">data viz</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">What I do</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">I connect user needs, complex systems and clear interfaces.</p>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"skill-list\" aria-label=\"Skills\">\n        <li><span class=\"badge\">Interaction design</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"badge\">User research</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"badge\">Design systems</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"badge\">Prototyping</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"badge\">Service design</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <blockquote class=\"card stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin:0\">\n      <div class=\"quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</div>\n      <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin:0\">Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.</p>\n      <footer>\n        <strong>Tina Zupan</strong>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">Head of Digital, LPP</div>\n      </footer>\n    </blockquote>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card contact-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-heading\">\n    <div class=\"row between gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"stat-label\">Next project</p>\n        <h2 id=\"contact-heading\" class=\"h2\">Let’s make something useful.</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Open to freelance work from January. Based in Ljubljana and available for remote collaboration.</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"mailto:mira@example.com\">Start a conversation</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>","deltas":[[4334,"<style>\n  .hero {\n  "],[4334,"  position: relative"],[4370,";\n    overflow: hidd"],[4381,"en;\n    padding: cla